# ── Supabase ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get these from: https://supabase.com/dashboard → Project Settings → API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# ── OpenAI API Key ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ⚠️  DO NOT add OPENAI_API_KEY here or to .env!
# The OpenAI key is stored as a Supabase Edge Function secret.
# It NEVER touches the frontend or any VITE_ variable.
#
# To set your key, run ONE of the following:
#
#   Option A — Supabase CLI (recommended):
#     supabase secrets set OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-...
#
#   Option B — Supabase Dashboard:
#     Dashboard → Edge Functions → Manage Secrets → Add OPENAI_API_KEY
